*.sln
*.sw?

# openWakeWord model files. The shared feature-extraction models are
# third-party (CC BY-NC-SA), so they are fetched at image build time rather
# than redistributed here — see the Dockerfile. hey_nota.onnx is our own
# trained model, and is checked in so a deployment built from a clone of
# this repo has a wake word at all.
public/oww/*
!public/oww/hey_nota.onnx
